      "textEvidence": {
        "text": "D.D. Warrior is a Level 4 EARTH Warrior Effect Monster with 1200 ATK and 1000 DEF. After damage calculation, when this monster battles another monster, its mandatory field Trigger Effect banishes both battle participants. Ordinary battle damage is applied first. This applies whether the D.D. Warrior attacked or defended, and even if one or both combatants would be destroyed by that same battle, without sending the banished cards to the Graveyard first. Banish cards to their original owners' banished zones. Skill Drain prevents resolution when the source's effect was negated during the calculation. No cost, targeting, optional choice or unrelated effects are printed. The card was released in OCG Vol.7 on 2000-01-27.",
