      "textEvidence": {
        "text": "Legendary Jujitsu Master is a Level 3 EARTH Rock Effect Monster with 1300 ATK and 1800 DEF. When this card in face-up Defense Position battles another monster, at the end of the Damage Step its mandatory effect puts the opponent's battling monster on top of its owner's Deck, after ordinary battle damage and destruction calculation. This effect still applies if Legendary Jujitsu Master itself was destroyed during that battle. It does not apply while the source was in Attack Position. The opponent's monster must still be available on the field to return; a Fusion Monster returns to its owner's Extra Deck instead of the Main Deck. Negation such as Skill Drain prevents this effect. No cost, targeting choice or additional printed effect is present. Its TCG printing AST-017 predates October 2004.",
